# SECRETS — never in an image.
#
# customers/ holds live Tradier tokens and the .sam login password. A
# container image is pushed to a registry and its layers are readable by
# anyone who can pull it, so baking this folder in would publish the keys to
# the live trading account. The deployment mounts these as Secret Manager
# files at runtime instead (see CLOUDRUN.md). Do not remove this line.
customers/
*.env
.env
!frontend/.env.production

# Local state. var/ is the SQLite ledger and the pid/log files of a machine
# that is not this container; the cloud deployment runs on Postgres.
var/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Build inputs that the image rebuilds itself, or does not need.
.venv/
**/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.git/
.github/
tests/

# Generated data that would only bloat the layer.
runtime/super_research/gex/
runtime/**/*.log
runtime/**/*.out

# Bot Station state. The bots CANNOT run in cloud mode (no place for a
# long-lived process, and the filesystem is wiped on every restart), so
# their scripts ship — the station still renders and still reports what is
# registered — but one machine's ledgers, locks, session state and scraped
# rankings have no business in an image.
runtime/prediction-trade/**/*.lock
runtime/prediction-trade/**/*_state.json
runtime/prediction-trade/**/*_state_paper.json
runtime/prediction-trade/**/*trade_history*.csv
runtime/prediction-trade/sports/tennis/web/archive_data/
